		<title>The Reifier</title>
		<link>https://elihenley.com/2024/06/27/the-reifier/</link>
					<comments>https://elihenley.com/2024/06/27/the-reifier/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[elihenley]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 27 Jun 2024 20:39:36 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[2024]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Electrical devices]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Sculptures]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://elihenley.com/?p=142</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[Steel, circuit boards, lights, misc. electronics components, wire, solder, hardware &#8211; 2024 (The Reifier relies on our tendency to project utterly meaningful assumed truths onto (conveniently) structured, arbitrary information.) The Reifier is a scientific electrical device. It surmises and transcribes the inner emotions of whomever wears it into convenient and knowable words. As the wearer [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1.jpeg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="799" height="1024" src="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1-799x1024.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-151" srcset="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1-799x1024.jpeg 799w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1-234x300.jpeg 234w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1-768x984.jpeg 768w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/reifier-8-Large-1.jpeg 999w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 799px) 100vw, 799px" /></a></figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Steel, circuit boards, lights, misc. electronics components, wire, solder, hardware &#8211; 2024</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p>(The Reifier relies on our tendency to project utterly meaningful assumed truths onto (conveniently) structured, arbitrary information.)</p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p>The Reifier is a scientific electrical device. It surmises and transcribes the inner emotions of whomever wears it into convenient and knowable words.</p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p>As the wearer speaks or moves their jaw, a button is pressed. This controls The Reifier, displaying an output with each press. This output can be used to understand the wearer’s state of being. each light corresponds to a specific mood or desire. The Quick Lookup Guide (below) diagrams each light’s associated meaning.</p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p>The Reifier uses no microcontrollers. Its circuitry is purpose built, making use of simple logic ICs and other discrete components. It uses a technology called <em>core rope memory</em>, which is a method of data storage that is programmed through the weaving of wires in and around magnetic cores.&nbsp;</p>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p><strong>Demonstration video</strong></p>



<figure class="wp-block-boldblocks-youtube-block"><div id="yb-video-lJ9GQcPnR7g" class="yb-player" data-video-id="lJ9GQcPnR7g" data-title="Play" style="background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/lJ9GQcPnR7g/maxresdefault.jpg)" data-params="{&quot;rel&quot;:0}"><button type="button" class="yb-btn-play"><span class="visually-hidden">Play</span></button></div></figure>



<div style="height:38px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<p><strong>Quick Lookup Guide</strong> (click to expand)</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large has-custom-border is-style-default" id="qlg"><a href="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed.jpg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="791" height="1024" src="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed-791x1024.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-153" style="border-style:none;border-width:0px;border-radius:0px;object-fit:cover" srcset="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed-791x1024.jpg 791w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed-232x300.jpg 232w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed-768x994.jpg 768w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/QLGv4-yellowed.jpg 850w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 791px) 100vw, 791px" /></a></figure>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://elihenley.com/2024/06/27/the-reifier/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
