<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p>A sealed box which broadcasts the sound within itself. You can &#8220;tune into&#8221; last Fluesday on 94.7 FM.</p>



<p>Inspired by Duchamp&#8217;s With Hidden Noise (1916) and 50cc of Paris Air (1919).</p>



<p></p>



<blockquote class="wp-block-quote is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow">
<p>All we’re allowed of Last Fluesday are the auditory and visual entrapments within this box, when it was last allowed to absorb the environment as it was; for it was then sealed with helical fasteners turned by a long and skinny rotator quite visibly angry.</p>
</blockquote>
