					<description><![CDATA[Construction materials, digital photo frame, landline phone, electronics &#8211; Tortuga Gallery, Abq NM &#8211; 2022 Interactive installation sculpture. This piece was on display at the Taylor Town event, housed by Tortuga Gallery in Albuquerque&#8217;s South Broadway neighborhood.  Answering the phone prompts a voicemail to play. There are 30 voicemails, with a random one selected each [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<figure class="wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-1 wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="710" data-id="77" src="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league4-1024x710.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-77" srcset="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league4-1024x710.jpeg 1024w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league4-300x208.jpeg 300w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league4-768x532.jpeg 768w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league4.jpeg 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</figure>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Construction materials, digital photo frame, landline phone, electronics &#8211; Tortuga Gallery, Abq NM &#8211; 2022</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p>Interactive installation sculpture. This piece was on display at the <a href="https://elihenley.com/2024/06/20/taylor-town/" data-type="post" data-id="88"><em>Taylor Town</em></a> event, housed by Tortuga Gallery in Albuquerque&#8217;s South Broadway neighborhood. </p>



<p></p>



<p>Answering the phone prompts a voicemail to play. There are 30 voicemails, with a random one selected each time the handset is picked up. Each voicemail was an interpretation of the prompt &#8220;something an angry, stifled suburban parent would say&#8221;.</p>



<p></p>



<p>The adjacent photo frame plays a looping slideshow of several hundred local real-estate photos.</p>



<div style="height:22px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="864" src="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league2-1024x864.jpeg" alt="" class="wp-image-76" srcset="https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league2-1024x864.jpeg 1024w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league2-300x253.jpeg 300w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league2-768x648.jpeg 768w, https://elihenley.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/league2.jpeg 1280w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
]]></content:encoded>
					
