<h2 class="wp-block-heading">rammed earth and metal sculpture &#8211; 2019</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p>Work commissioned by the Sevilleta National Wildlife Refuge. My design proposal was selected by the refuge and Constructed by students in UNM’s Art and Ecology program.</p>



<p>Sculpture depicts 100 years of rainwater variance and declining precipitation as recorded at the refuge.</p>



